ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nA bookstore has 20 science fiction novels. The clerk tells the customer that the vast majority are works of domestic authors, with very few works of European, American, and Japanese authors. After browsing, the customer finds that only 2 are works of Japanese authors.\n\n[Question]\nHow many does the customer guess are works of domestic authors after browsing?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After browsing, the customer guesses that there are 18 works of domestic authors.\nB. After browsing, the customer guesses that there are 15 works of domestic authors.\nC. After browsing, the customer guesses that there are 12 works of domestic authors.\nD. After browsing, the customer guesses that there are 10 works of domestic authors.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725512269643934,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1c1d6006945d28005ed","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367937623,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"49b877452ab04d53811b5d21746baf8e"}